<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7810" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναχορεύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>begin a choral dance,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Th.</u>
				994
			</span></i>: and c. acc. cogn., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. θίασον,
				ὄργια,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				1756
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ba.</u>
				482
			</span></i>,al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>celebrate in the chorus,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Βάκχιον</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				1153
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐκ ἄν με . . ἀνεχόρευ᾽ Ἐρινύσι</span>
			<i>would</i> not <i>have scared</i> me <i>away by a band</i>
			of Furies, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Or.</u>
				582
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> intr.,
				<i>dance for joy,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνεχόρευσεν αἰθήρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Ion</u>
					1079
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
